Non-core: explicit DM approval required.{{/if}}</span></span>{{/if}}{{#if ratingLabel}}<small class="mc-rank-label">{{ratingLabel}}</small>{{/if}}{{#if dmApproval}}<small class="mc-dm-note">Rating 4+: explicit DM approval required.</small>{{/if}}
