Non-core: explicit DM approval required.{{/if}}{{#if isAvatar}} Starting Quintessence equals the Avatar rating.{{/if}}</span></span>{{/if}}{{#if ratingLabel}}<small class="mc-rank-label">{{ratingLabel}}</small>{{/if}}{{#if dmApproval}}<small class="mc-dm-note">Rating 4+: explicit DM approval required.</small>{{/if}}
                                    
